<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and KB International Group.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ ACTING THROUGH</p>
<p>		ITS LUXEMBOURG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    23.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.02 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
